      "result": "{\"cursor\":10310,\"log\":\"\\nGrk41F Drama casts Earthbender Ascension from hand\\nGrk41F Drama puts Earthbender Ascension from stack onto the Battlefield\\nGrk41F Drama - Ability triggers: Earthbender Ascension - When Earthbender Ascension enters, earthbend 2. (Target land you control becomes a 0/0 creature with haste that\\u0027s still a land. Put two +1/+1 counters on it. When it dies or is exiled, return it to the battlefield tapped.) Then search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle. -  targeting Forest\\nGrk41F Drama searches their library (source: Earthbender Ascension)\\nGrk41F Drama puts Forest from library onto the Battlefield (source: Earthbender Ascension)\\nGrk41F Drama\\u0027s library is shuffled (source: Earthbender Ascension)\\nGrk41F Drama - Ability triggers: Earthbender Ascension - Landfall \\u0026mdash; Whenever a land you control enters, put a quest counter on Earthbender Ascension. When you do, if it has four or more quest counters on it, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control. It gains trample until end of turn.\\nGrk41F Drama casts Mightform Harmonizer with Warp from hand\\nGrk41F Drama puts Mightform Harmonizer from stack onto the Battlefield\\nGrk41F Drama attacks Gem25F Undrdog with 1 creature\\nAttacker: Badgermole Cub (2/2) unblocked\\nGem25F Undrdog loses 2 life at combat from Badgermole Cub\\nGrk41F Drama - Ability triggers: Mightform Harmonizer - At the beginning of the next end step, exile this creature if it was cast for its warp cost.\\nGrk41F Drama moves Mightform Harmonizer from battlefield to the exile zone\\nGrk41F Drama turn 3 (18 - 16)\\nGem25F Undrdog draws a card\\nGem25F Undrdog puts Sunbillow Verge from hand onto the Battlefield\\nGem25F Undrdog plays Sunbillow Verge\",\"truncated\":false,\"total_length\":10310}",
