      "decision_index": 84,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Grk41F Drama chose not to attack with Mightform Harmonizer (4/4) into an empty board when the opponent is at 7 life. Attacking would put the opponent to 3 life, making lethal trivially easy next turn. The opponent has no blockers, so there is zero risk in attacking.",
      "action_taken": "Declined to attack with Mightform Harmonizer, leaving the opponent comfortably at 7 life.",
      "better_line": "Attack with Mightform Harmonizer for 4 damage, putting the opponent to 3 life. This creates immediate lethal pressure and forces the opponent to find an answer or die next combat.",
